comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T05:19:34.722Z",codex-sol,"Real tev1 acceptance found that Ollama rejects explicit criteria:null for noul although the official SDK Questions type permits it. Caller-file parsing now omits absent noul criteria while preserving explicit true/false descriptions. The initial live triage selected Bug at probability 0.944 and priority 0 at 0.979; dedupe selected the existing synthetic item. Full live acceptance is being rerun after the compatibility fix."
  "2026-10-05T05:56:43.123Z",codex-sol,"Verified the shared 17 command/transport tests within the 86-test all-source suite: real TypeSafe SDK HTTP, host extension harness, and isolated real pm projects. All source coverage dimensions are 100%; live local tev1 schema/plausibility and packed npm/Bun installation acceptance passed. Implementation and receipts are linked in README.md and docs/v0-validation.md. Leaving this item in progress for orchestrator verification and closure."
  "2026-10-11T05:15:29.714Z",codex-sol,"Acceptance met on main 7c0f0e0: index.ts:1270 runAskCommand loads and validates caller JSON questions, bounds the item projection and returns typed answers/model/usage. Tests: typed question files reject invalid shapes and preserve every primitive (test/decisions.test.ts:60); ask, dedupe, gate and discovery dispatch on a real temporary tracker (:88), including a legal __proto__ question name and absent noul criteria. Fresh main acceptance: node --test test/agent-ux.test.ts test/decisions.test.ts test/transport.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/calibration.test.ts passed 51/51, zero failures/skips. Tracker schema has no review status, so status stays in_progress; not closed. Cross-reference docs/tracker-reconciliation.md; line numbers refer to checked main."
